@startuml
title Green Rides System States

[*] --> Login : User logs in

state "Login" as Login
Login : entry / Authenticate user credentials
Login : do / Display journey details upon successful login
Login : exit / Destination selection

state "Destination Selection" as DestinationSelection
DestinationSelection : entry / Select destination
DestinationSelection : do / Activate driving mode or choose other options
DestinationSelection : exit / Journey begins

state "Journey Begins" as JourneyBegins
JourneyBegins : entry / Enable users to select a place to eat
JourneyBegins : do / View menu and place an order if hungry
JourneyBegins : exit / Continue driving or accident occurs

state "Driving Mode" as DrivingMode
DrivingMode : entry / Send notifications during driving
DrivingMode : do / Inform relevant authorities in case of an accident
DrivingMode : exit / Journey ends

state "Accident Occurs" as AccidentOccurs
AccidentOccurs : entry / Send notifications and inform authorities
AccidentOccurs : do / Provide feedback upon completion of journey
AccidentOccurs : exit / System terminates

state "Feedback Provided" as FeedbackProvided
FeedbackProvided : entry / User provides feedback
FeedbackProvided : do / System terminates

Login --> DestinationSelection : [login successful]
DestinationSelection --> JourneyBegins : [destination selected]

JourneyBegins --> DrivingMode : [driving mode activated]
DrivingMode --> AccidentOccurs : [accident occurs]
AccidentOccurs --> FeedbackProvided : [journey completed]

FeedbackProvided --> [*] : [system terminated]

@enduml
